  "question": "求微分方程 $(1 - x)y'' = \\frac{1}{5}\\sqrt{1 + y'^2}$ 满足 $y(0) = 0, y'(0) = 0$ 的特解.",
  "answer": "$y = - \\frac {5}{8} (1 - x) ^ {\\frac {4}{5}} + \\frac {5}{1 2} (1 - x) ^ {\\frac {6}{5}} + \\frac {5}{2 4}.$",
